conversation:
  SPEAKER_00: "Hello."
  SPEAKER_01: "Hello."
  SPEAKER_01: "Yes."
  SPEAKER_01: "Good morning."
  SPEAKER_01: "Is this Jhanvi speaking?"
  SPEAKER_00: "Yes, tell me."
  SPEAKER_01: "Yes, I am talking about Jhansi from Better Study."
  SPEAKER_01: "Are you searching for Jhanvi College for studies?"
  SPEAKER_00: "Yes."
  SPEAKER_01: "Okay."
  SPEAKER_01: "For which course?"
  SPEAKER_00: "D.Tech."
  SPEAKER_01: "Okay."
  SPEAKER_01: "Computer Science Engineering?"
  SPEAKER_01: "Yes."
  SPEAKER_01: "And for which location are you searching?"
  SPEAKER_00: "Location is not that far but maybe Pune, Lucknow, Bangalore side something more south side."
  SPEAKER_01: "Okay, how much is your budget?"
  SPEAKER_00: "My budget is maximum 12 lakhs."
  SPEAKER_01: "Okay, are you looking for accommodation or you are just telling me about academic?"
  SPEAKER_00: "now for big tech it will take a lot of time because we have done a lot of college searches because in big tech and engineering it will take a lot of time yes it will take a lot of time but what specialization do you want to do in this?"
  SPEAKER_01: "will you select other branch or AI, ML or cyber security?"
  SPEAKER_00: "no we will select one more PIC etc?"
  SPEAKER_00: "yes ok tell me the percentage in 12th"
  SPEAKER_00: "right now we are late for the tour, I haven't got the result yet okay, the result is pending what is your board?"
  SPEAKER_01: "Maharashtra board?"
  SPEAKER_01: "no no, CBSE so you have CBSE board, okay so there is no issue, you will get the college so your first location preference will be Pune, right?"
  SPEAKER_00: "by the way, I don't have any, I want to study in Pune Lucknow, Bangalore, Chennai"
  SPEAKER_00: "There are many colleges in New York, but I won't go to Delhi or Mumbai because parents won't allow me to go there."
  SPEAKER_01: "You don't want to go to Delhi or Mumbai, right?"
  SPEAKER_01: "No."
  SPEAKER_01: "Okay, there is no issue."
  SPEAKER_01: "Other locations like Jaipur are comfortable, right?"
  SPEAKER_00: "Yes, Jaipur and Dundee are also comfortable."
  SPEAKER_00: "Because it is not so far for a girl."
  SPEAKER_00: "Yes, the atmosphere in Delhi is also a bit like that."
  SPEAKER_00: "Yes, right."
  SPEAKER_01: "That's why parents don't allow it."
  SPEAKER_01: "I have heard this from some students."
  SPEAKER_01: "Girls don't allow it."
  SPEAKER_00: "Yes, they don't allow it."
  SPEAKER_00: "I don't want to go there."
  SPEAKER_01: "No problem."
  SPEAKER_01: "I will tell you a very good college in Jaipur."
  SPEAKER_01: "Have you heard of JECRC University in Jaipur?"
  SPEAKER_00: "Yes, I have heard of it."
  SPEAKER_01: "JECRC will be the best option for you in Jaipur."
  SPEAKER_01: "If you have so much budget, then JECRC is one of the best option in Jaipur, Rajasthan."
  SPEAKER_01: "University is very good."
  SPEAKER_01: "UGC is approved."
  SPEAKER_01: "Last year, they have given more than 10,000 placements."
  SPEAKER_01: "And till now."
  SPEAKER_01: "Last year, more than 1,500."
  SPEAKER_01: "If we talk about the average package here, then 8 to 9 LP is your average package."
  SPEAKER_01: "8 to 9 lakhs."
  SPEAKER_00: "It will show, but it will be more difficult."
  SPEAKER_00: "No, I am telling you."
  SPEAKER_01: "Look, packages always depend on the student."
  SPEAKER_01: "Okay?"
  SPEAKER_01: "Yes, it depends on the university."
  SPEAKER_00: "There is a highest package that very few people get."
  SPEAKER_00: "There is an average package that maximum people get."
  SPEAKER_00: "So, we should say the average package."
  SPEAKER_00: "how much we are getting according to that because if we don't get good packages then it will be like we are investing 12 lakhs so how much are you expecting average package?"
  SPEAKER_00: "average package should be 10 line but it should be like that not like they are telling before that 10 line is 9 and after going there it is known that it is not so they are lying there are many colleges that fake"
  SPEAKER_01: "I will tell you."
  SPEAKER_01: "First of all, I will tell you that I am talking to Better Study Jaipur Rajasthan."
  SPEAKER_01: "This is a platform in which the child is connected with us for 4 years."
  SPEAKER_01: "Okay?"
  SPEAKER_01: "Overall, if the child faces any problem, the student calls us and says, Sir, you told us about this."
  SPEAKER_01: "That thing is not there here."
  SPEAKER_01: "If there is any issue, the child contacts us within 4 years."
  SPEAKER_01: "So, for that, you should be sure that you are going to face any problem in college."
  SPEAKER_01: "Okay?"
  SPEAKER_00: "No, we have heard this a lot."
  SPEAKER_00: "We have heard this a lot from the seniors."
  SPEAKER_00: "At the time of admission, there is a lot of management."
  SPEAKER_00: "But after admission,"
  SPEAKER_00: "The manager behaves very rudely."
  SPEAKER_00: "We are here for this."
  SPEAKER_00: "We have to understand everything."
  SPEAKER_00: "Absolutely."
  SPEAKER_01: "You have a very good decision."
  SPEAKER_01: "It's a big thing if you are thinking so much at this age."
  SPEAKER_01: "But I want to say that we are here for this."
  SPEAKER_01: "If there is any issue, you can connect with me."
  SPEAKER_01: "You will not face any problem."
  SPEAKER_01: "Because we connect with only those universities whose overall placement is good."
  SPEAKER_01: "The child does not face any problem there."
  SPEAKER_01: "Even today, my students are studying well there."
  SPEAKER_01: "Now let me tell you, I have a student named Aditya who is studying in JK Laxmipat University in Jaipur, Rajasthan."
  SPEAKER_01: "Recently, the child is studying in IIT Gandhinagar because he got exposure through JK Laxmipat."
  SPEAKER_01: "There is one university in Jaipur, Rajasthan, JK Laxmipat, JKLU, Mahapura Road."
